# A walnut captain's chair with a teal cushion, seen from the front. Goes on
# the reader's tile behind the reading table. zbias -1 paints it before the
# person, so only the back shows round their head and shoulders.
sprite library-chair
size 16 32
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 16
walkable
zbias -1
tag chair seat library
variant oak w=o W=O 3=1

frame default
